{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The firm is separately classified within the circular's definition of licensed firms.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Implementation for the footnote 2 trigger begins at the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The event history distinguishes a contact, a submission, a resubmission and an automatic record migration.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The footnote 2 trigger quantifies over submissions of this same STR: at least one qualifying post-implementation submission is sufficient to trigger the stated resubmission requirement.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The blackout urgent-contact instruction is retained as a distinct transitional instruction and is not treated as permission to use alternative channels after launch.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The retained footnote does not by itself extend the resubmission trigger to contacts or submissions occurring only during the blackout.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3.a6","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Triggering the requirement and subsequently discharging it are separate questions. The trigger remains historically true after a successful resubmission.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"81ffc86edff7249a1987d5daf38664b812caeb1834cfc2d0cd62998548f6640b","candidate_id":"candidate.ac8f60eabf1041caae74f87c033f3aec","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] True means that the assessed licensed firm's STR has at least one submission to the JFIU through a channel other than STREAMS 2 following implementation, so the stated requirement to resubmit that STR through STREAMS 2 is triggered. False means that no such qualifying submission exists in the established event history. Unknown or incomplete event history must not be treated as false. This answers whether the resubmission trigger occurred, not whether the firm has complied with or discharged the obligation. Separately, an STR requiring urgent submission during the blackout calls for direct JFIU contact by email, phone or fax; that instruction is not evaluated by this trigger. These proposed meanings confer no legal approval.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["time"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"Reviewing the submission-event model exposes a missing relation between multiple events concerning the same STR. A single off_platform Boolean would conflate urgent blackout contact, a post-launch alternative-channel submission and an automatically migrated old record. Only the second supplies the stated footnote 2 trigger. A later STREAMS 2 resubmission cannot make the original event comply with the exclusive-channel requirement, and the fact that a trigger occurred does not establish an outstanding or overdue obligation.","run_id":"run.f9cab12e5709452f9b6e3121495ab6bf","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"71c3627a60fbdf7e662cc30b3dae7b8ff95e13a67ad5eade35f0a35874e23663","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Resubmission trigger distinguished from blackout contact and subsequent discharge"}